  "metadata_synthesis": "2015 blockbuster sequel. The messy middle chapter of the Infinity Saga. A bloated superhero spectacle.",
  "setting_and_subculture": "High-tech glossy towers. Fictional Eastern European rubble. A secretive farmhouse.",
  "visual_tone_and_feel": "Saturated CGI destruction. Desaturated Eastern European concrete. Neon red chaos magic. Flashy armor polish.",
  "media_era_tone": "Peak mid-2010s MCU formula. Whedonesque quip-heavy dialogue. Franchise world-building overload.",
  "pacing_and_structure": "Frenetic opening strike. A jarring farmhouse detour. A world-ending meteor finale. Bloated and episodic.",
  "atmosphere_and_mood": "Manic quipping hiding exhaustion. Artificial intelligence dread. Awkward forced intimacy.",
  "themes_and_messages": "The hubris of creating life. Unintended consequences of a shield around the world. Sins of the creators.",
  "character_relationships": "Forced, chemistry-free green and red romance. Snarky AI versus its maker. Vengeful twins. The guy with arrows and his secret family.",
  "lead_character_type": "Hubristic genius billionaire. Sexy voiced murder robot. Guilt-ridden witch. Farm dad archer.",
  "story_and_plot_type": "Frankenstein monster tale. Global extinction threat. Superhero ensemble crisis.",
  "who_and_when": "Fictional present-day Sokovia. Arrogant heroes. A murder-bot with daddy issues.",
  "emotional_evocation": "Overstimulating fatigue. Accidental robotic thirst. Confusion at sudden romance. Eye-rolling at excessive quips.",
